## Business Processes

### Process 1: Campaign Creation
```
Creator → Register → Create Campaign → Upload Docs → Submit → Admin Reviews → Published
```

### Process 2: Campaign Discovery & Donation
```
Donor → Open Marketplace → Search/Filter → Select Campaign → Donate → Receipt
```

### Process 3: Recurring Donation
```
Donor → Select Campaign → Choose Monthly → Setup Subscription → Monthly Charges → Receipts
```

### Process 4: Verification Workflow
```
Creator Submits → Admin Queue → Review Docs → Approve/Reject → Creator Notified
```

### Process 5: Impact Reporting
```
Creator → Request Report → AI Processes Data → Report Generated → Available for Download
```

