## Assumptions

| # | Assumption | Impact if Wrong |
|---|---|---|
| A-01 | Campaign creators will provide valid documents | Verification backlog increases |
| A-02 | Donors want to browse multiple campaigns | Marketplace design wasted |
| A-03 | 80G receipts are legally required for all donations | Compliance risk |
| A-04 | Razorpay Subscriptions API supports monthly INR plans | Must find alternative |
| A-05 | AI/LLM API is available and affordable | Impact reports unavailable |
| A-06 | Supabase free/pro tier supports storage needs | May need plan upgrade |
| A-07 | Campaign creators are willing to wait for verification | Creator churn |
| A-08 | v1.0 database schema is compatible with migration | Complex migration needed |

