## Constraints

| # | Constraint | Type | Impact |
|---|---|---|---|
| C-01 | Test mode only (no real money) | Business | Limited to demo/POC |
| C-02 | Single developer + AI agent | Resource | Sequential development |
| C-03 | Supabase tier limits | Budget | Storage and function limits |
| C-04 | Simulator distribution only | Technical | No TestFlight without developer account |
| C-05 | iOS 16 Minimum Target | Technical | API restrictions |
| C-06 | v1.0 backward compatibility required | Technical | Cannot break existing data |
