## Risks

| # | Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| R-01 | Razorpay Subscriptions API complexity | Medium | High | Feature-flag; fallback to manual reminders |
| R-02 | AI report quality insufficient | Medium | Medium | Human review + quality threshold |
| R-03 | Verification bottleneck (too many submissions) | Low | Medium | Batch review tools for admin |
| R-04 | v1.0 migration data loss | Low | Critical | Dry run migration; backup before execution |
| R-05 | Supabase Storage limits exceeded | Low | Medium | Monitor usage; plan upgrade path |
| R-06 | PDF generation library issues on Deno | Medium | High | Test multiple libraries; have fallback |
| R-07 | Campaign abuse (fake/fraudulent) | Medium | High | Strong verification; admin tools |
| R-08 | Schema migration breaks v1.0 functionality | Low | Critical | Feature flags; staged rollout |

